== For People Interested in Physics
<for-people-interested-in-physics>
#link("http://phys.org")[Phys.org] popularises frontier researches with easy-to-read summaries and provides back-links to the related journal articles; #link("https://www.notion.so/Why-RSS-640ab92873194602a278cfce60f676ce")[its feed on general physics], in particular, often gives out high-quality content.

#link("https://www.symmetrymagazine.org/")[Symmetry] focuses more on Particle Physics and often gives out soft content that serves as good reading.

= From other websites to RSS
<from-other-websites-to-rss>
Some blogs offer RSS buttons that you can subscribe its RSS by simply clicking them, but for others you need certain tricks.

